The original MIT license and provenance remain in third_party_licenses/llama-LICENSE
and third_party_licenses/llama.md. The Windows OpenMP runtime retains its license
in third_party_licenses/llvm-OpenMP-LICENSE.

Open Computer Use
-----------------
Computer-use helper sources are pinned to ifuryst/open-computer-use commit
8fdda42639c94fa2ce22ea2d9d706b5919a83b42 (MIT). Sailry applies the reviewed scoped
session cleanup and bundle identity patch in scripts/package/ocu. Source and
patch checksums are recorded in scripts/package/ocu-helper.lock.json.
The retained upstream notices cover its Cua Driver and yabai derived components
and static libwebp dependency; see third_party_licenses/open-computer-use-LICENSE
and third_party_licenses/open-computer-use-NOTICE.
